Error [E1001]: `core.text.runtime.kernel_unicode_string.lower` is private to Core
  --> user_program_cannot_import_a_runtime_unit_2.jet:1:5
    |
  1 | use core.text.runtime.kernel_unicode_string.[lower]
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `core.<area>.runtime` units implement the Core library; only Core sources import them
 Fix: Use the public module `core.text` instead
